cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and also cite the flyvis
  model it reproduces (listed under references).
title: semblance
abstract: >-
  Connectome compression research in Rust: take a connectome-constrained model
  that predicts real neural recordings, compress its representation, and
  measure how far it can shrink before it stops behaving like the fly.
type: software
authors:
